Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 12:14:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 070/117] dt-bindings: mfd: add Apple SN2400 charger

Document the SN2400 parent device together with its HDQ mux and charger
children. Describe the register ranges, mux routing, battery
relationship, and current limits used by Apple devices.

Signed-off-by: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>

Orchard-replay-of: a88970fb84b7a933f3445ce6d8c65c4aeab3e913
---
